aims."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"Typography","timestamp_seconds":0,"problem":"The opening text is readable, but the final CTA text feels oversized and repetitive rather than elegantly resolved.","fix":"Use one strong hook line and one clean final CTA card; avoid repeating the same CTA treatment across multiple frames."},{"severity":"MEDIUM","category":"Visual Variety","timestamp_seconds":6,"problem":"The visual language over-relies on chef-hands-at-board compositions, reducing novelty in the middle of the reel.","fix":"Prioritize a tighter mix of plated reveal, macro detail, one action beat, and one human finishing beat."}]
